  "body_html": "<p>Add a bold, personalized touch to your bedroom with this custom trucking-themed comforter set from Jeminise, designed specifically for truckers and truck enthusiasts.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this bedding set with your own name or custom text for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Factual Visual Motif:</strong> Features a striking digital illustration of a semi truck breaking through a stone wall on a cracked surface.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Options:</strong> Available as either a Duvet Cover (no filling) or a Comforter (with filling), with optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in standard US Twin, Full, Queen, and King sizes to fit your bed perfectly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Old Vintage Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
